dynamodb = boto3.resource('dynamodb')
table = dynamodb.Table('CustomerData')

# Write data
table.put_item(Item={'CustomerID': '101', 'Name': 'Dnyaneshwar'})

# Read data
response = table.get_item(Key={'CustomerID': '101'})
print(response['Item'])
👉 This works because EC2 has the Role attached with the right permissions.

