s3:ListBucket → Allows listing objects in the bucket.

s3:GetObject → Allows reading/download of the files.

arn:aws:s3:::bucket-name/* → Grants permission to all objects inside the bucket.

🔹 Step 2: Create IAM Role for EC2
Go to IAM → Roles → Create Role.

Select Trusted entity = AWS service → EC2.

Attach the S3 read-only policy you just created.

